<p>This page describes the cookies and similar technologies (browser local storage) used on this site, in line with Article 82 of the French Data Protection Act and the CNIL guidelines and recommendations of 17 September 2020.</p>

<h2>1. Our approach</h2>
<p>This site is designed to work <strong>without advertising or tracking technologies</strong>. Fonts are self-hosted, so no requests are sent to third parties while you browse. No non-essential tracker is set before you give your consent.</p>

<h2>2. Strictly necessary storage (exempt from consent)</h2>
<div class="table-wrap">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>nu-consent</code></td><td>Remember your cookie choices</td><td>6 months</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>nu-theme</code></td><td>Remember the light or dark theme you chose</td><td>Until you delete it</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>nu-lang</code></td><td>Remember the language you chose</td><td>Until you delete it</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
<p>This information is stored in your browser, contains no identifying data and is never sent to {site.name}.</p>

<h2>3. Trackers requiring your consent</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Audience measurement:</strong> no tool is currently active. If one is added, it will be described here (provider, purpose, cookie lifetime of 13 months maximum) and only enabled with your consent.</li>
  <li><strong>Third-party content:</strong> no third-party content (video, map) is currently embedded. If added, it will only be displayed with your consent.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Managing your choices</h2>
<p>On your first visit, a banner lets you accept, reject or customise trackers. Rejecting is as easy as accepting; your choice is kept for 6 months, then asked again. You can change it at any time:</p>
<p><button type="button" class="btn" data-cookie-open>Manage my cookie preferences</button></p>
<p>You can also delete stored data from your browser settings.</p>

<h2>5. Learn more</h2>
<p>See our <a href={url("privacy", "en")}>privacy policy</a> or the CNIL website: <a href="https://www.cnil.fr/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cnil.fr/en</a>.</p>
